 =========================================================================
                          - About S-Adder v3.3 -
 =========================================================================

 S-Adder is a neat & simple to install LHA/LZH checker.
 This is only a small update but a usefull one.
 This time, no matter how big the archive is, you won't get an
 out of memory problem.
 This version also uses sum trix to make it superior other checkers.

 Nothing more to it, get on with it.  






 =========================================================================
                        - Installing S-Adder v3.3 -
 =========================================================================


 Copy the FCheck icons to their place.

 Put the files in my S/ dir into your S: dir.
 LHA.Strip is all the filenames wich will be stripped from the archives.
 All bloody adverts will be gone.

 Create a dir on you HD called S:SiL
 And in s:Sil/ you put as many files as you like. All files will
 be added to the archive, BBS adverts or whatever.

 That's all, if you can't handle it then read the bloody dox for AE
 or something.. Cu


